WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.544
In the early Northern Song, on the northern border pass, the Song army's towers stood tall, banners flying in the wind, guarding the northern land.

00:00:11.894 --> 00:00:14.702
The garrison kept watch over the border day and night.

00:00:15.052 --> 00:00:22.708
The elderly General Yang Ye personally drilled the young soldiers on the training ground.

00:00:23.058 --> 00:00:30.930
The Yang father and sons wore armor, and there were brave women generals too — the whole family guarded the country side by side.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:41.768
The Song and Liao armies faced off on the plain, banners crossing, dust flying, war drums beating, the mood tense.

00:00:42.118 --> 00:00:49.126
The captured Yang Ye refused food to show his resolve, turning his head away and not eating a single bite.

00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:52.860
His loyalty moved everyone with admiration.

00:00:53.210 --> 00:01:01.730
Later, people sang the story of the Yang family generals on opera stages, and the spirit of loyalty and courage in serving the country lives on forever.

